# Official mcpg plugin-signing public keys (Ed25519, PEM SPKI).
# Compiled into the gateway as built-in trust anchors for entries that
# configure no keys of their own. Empty until the first official key is
# issued; append, never replace, so older releases stay verifiable.
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEA384qk+n6Hn7NBNYS+uMdoQ0CMxvdl79sxEHvfiVhSPc=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
# Key 2 — the release lane's active signing identity (public half of the
# MCPG_PLUGIN_SIGNING_KEY in service since 2026-06-14). Its absence here is
# why every artifact signed by CD failed official-key verification: the
# secret was rotated without appending its public half, and disabled-policy
# deployments masked it until the baked-plugin verify gate went red.
# Ed25519 raw: e73c783d0bd7296d11bd25c146962c1dd0658482b19119dd80b3a52c8bb7b14a
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEA5zx4PQvXKW0RvSXBRpYsHdBlhIKxkRndgLOlLIu3sUo=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
